Catalog: `Data/DATASETS.md`

Label overlap: names are not a shared taxonomy. Letter-by-letter clash
(case ignored) is only soldier:
`Soldier_KIIT-MiTA` vs `soldier_military_object_dataset`.

## CNN crops

1. `Data/localize.py` crops every box into `Data/CNN/` plus `Data/CNN/labels.csv`.
2. `Data/make_cnn_data.py` copies a smaller set into `Data/CNN-Data/`.
   Training (train + validation) is capped at 1000 per label. Test is capped
   at 50 per label. Dropped labels and merges are in that script.

Current **CNN-Data** (MV crops added 23 Sep 2026):
- Layout: `train/<label>/`, `test/<label>/`, `validation/<label>/`, `labels.csv`
- 10 labels. Training instances 9,541. Test instances 617. Total 10,158.
- Added 843 MV crops from one file per source photo: carriers and tanks into
  military_vehicle, MV soldiers into camouflage_soldier. 345 MV boxes were
  refused because the short side was under 32.
- Removed: car, Vehicle, van, truck, bus, motor, bicycle, tricycle,
  awning-tricycle, people, pedestrian, civilian, civilian_vehicle, weapon.
- Merged: military_tank, Tank, and military_truck into military_vehicle;
  military_artillery and Artilary into Artillery;
  Soldier_KIIT-MiTA and soldier_military_object_dataset into Soldier.
  camouflage_soldier stays separate.
- Trench train and test were swapped: 37 training images, 7 test images.
- military_warship: 900 training, 100 test. The 100 test crops are 10% of the
  previous 1,000 training crops (seed 42). Do not run
  `make_cnn_data.reshape_existing()`: the test cap of 50 would delete
  50 of those warship test crops and would also drop the added MV crops.
- `labels.csv` matches the files on disk.
- Full crop dump still lives in `Data/CNN/` (55388 rows after the VISDRONE
  crops were removed). Do not delete it unless the user asks.
- Edge Impulse project `Sentinel-X` (id 1117835) still has the previous
  12-label upload. It does not include this vehicle merge or trench swap.

## Key files

- `SENTINEL-X Project Description.md` - architecture and expo positioning
- `Data/DATASETS.md` - dataset tables
- `Data/localize.py` - full crop pipeline
- `Data/make_cnn_data.py` - CNN-Data sampler (training max 1000, test max 50)
- `Data/add_mv_to_cnn.py` - copies one MV source photo's crops into CNN-Data.
- `Data/EffNet.py` - EfficientNet-B0 trainer (224x224, ImageNet, 10 classes, cosine LR, light augmentation). Refuses crops with short side under 32.
- `Data/EffNet_b0.pt` - 23 Sep 2026 retrain after the MV crops were added. Test accuracy 0.8901 (494/555). Same file size, 16,359,802 bytes.
- `Data/EffNet_b0_before_mv.pt` - the 21 Sep checkpoint, test accuracy 0.8765 on the earlier 510-image test.
- `Data/hog_svm.py` - linear SVM on 96x96 HOG features, same crop gate as EffNet.
- `Data/HogSvm.pkl` - 23 Sep 2026. Test accuracy 0.5063 (281/555). File is 349,422 bytes.
- `Data/simple_cnn.py` - small 96x96 CNN from scratch. Current MV map is carriers and tanks to military_vehicle, soldiers to camouflage_soldier.
- `Data/SimpleCNN.pt` - 23 Sep 2026 checkpoint. 99,210 parameters, 408,000 bytes. Test accuracy 0.4627 (254/549).
- `Data/CNN-MV/` - MV crops that passed the 32-pixel gate (3,361 kept, 1,716 refused).
- `Data/CNN-Combined/labels.csv` - the list the small CNN trained on. Does not replace `Data/CNN-Data`.
- `Data/test_simple_cnn.py` - label map, cap, and network shape tests
- `Data/test_effnet.py` - unit test for the 32-pixel crop gate
- `Data/YOLO-Models-Final/` - three finished weights taken from origin/main on 23 Sep 2026: `KIIT-MiTA-yolo26s.pt` (20,321,797 bytes), `MV-yolo26s.pt` (20,477,189 bytes), `military-yolov8n.pt` (6,325,610 bytes). Commit `66aad224`.
- `Data/jetson_test.py` - maps YOLO names onto the 10 CNN labels and scores both models on the same crops. `Data/test_jetson_test.py` checks that map.
- `Data/drone_flight_30s.mp4` - synthetic 30 s, 32 fps, 1280x720 flight (960 frames). Each of the 10 labels is one real training photo for 3 seconds, with a slow camera drift. `Data/drone_flight_30s_objects.csv` lists the frame range and source file. Built by `Data/make_drone_video.py`.
- `Data/video/cnn_correct/` - 10 wider aerial photos whose objects EfficientNet named correctly, plus `prompt.txt`. Close-up crops were replaced on 23 Sep 2026. Camouflage is the least overhead of the set.
- `Data/join_and_detect_video.py` - joins every `Data/video/Drone_*.mp4` in timestamp order with an 0.8 s fade, then draws YOLO and EfficientNet on each frame. `Data/test_join_and_detect_video.py` checks the fade times and box overlap.
- `Data/video/sentinel_demo.py` - demo window. Run `python sentinel_demo.py` from `Data/video`. Chat is 40 percent of the detection row and the video is 60 percent. After a pause, Sentinel version 1.0 types a 60-word introduction. The window loads and warms the three YOLO weights and EfficientNet in the background, then Qwen. Play shows the first frame at once and draws boxes on `combined_drone.mp4`. On the Jetson, YOLO loads the TensorRT `.engine` beside each `.pt` when that file exists. The Credit tab cites KIIT-MiTA, military_object_dataset, and MV.
- `Data/YOLO/<dataset>/run_yolo.py` - short Ultralytics script under `if __name__ == "__main__"`. Train line uses `device=0` so it runs on the RTX 3060. Change the `YOLO("...")` name, then run that file.
- `Data/upload_to_edge_impulse.py` - Edge Impulse uploader for CNN-Data crops
- `Data/EDGE_IMPULSE_CNN.md` - Edge Impulse workflow notes
- `.env` exists. Never read it into memory or commit it.

